<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 2.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    94/95    101/102     UNQ     188/190</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   96/98    103/105   189/192   200/205</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes on Monday held steady amid lack of enquries in dull post-weekend mood, traders said. They said the bunker market was also tracking stable cargo prices. Some said weak prices in Rotterdam may drag prices lower later this week. -- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
